Validate page bounds (clamp to 1..max) and return total pages alongside data so the UI can disable next/prev correctly.

```js
function muatTurun(data, nama = 'data.json') {
  const url = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(data, null, 2)], { type: 'application/json' }));
  const a = Object.assign(document.createElement('a'), { href: url, download: nama });
  a.click();
  URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
}
```
Always revoke object URLs after use to free memory. For large exports, stream chunks instead of building one giant string.
